#. module: library
#: model:product.template,description_sale:library.product_template_17
msgid ""
"A collection of Hockney's iPad drawings capturing the changing view from his "
"window, celebrated for their vibrant, digital-medium immediacy."
msgstr ""
"霍克尼 iPad 绘画作品集，捕捉他窗外景色的变化，以其鲜明生动、数字媒介的直接感"
"染力而备受赞誉。"

#. module: library
#: model:product.template,description_sale:library.product_template_34
msgid ""
"A comprehensive chronicle of Donald Duck's evolution across animation and "
"comics since his debut."
msgstr "全面记述唐老鸭自首次亮相以来在动画与漫画中的演变历程。"

#. module: library
#: model:product.template,description_sale:library.product_template_28
msgid ""
"A monograph on the German painter known for bold, cartoonish figures in "
"vivid primary colors, blending abstraction with pop sensibility."
msgstr ""
"这位德国画家的专著，他以鲜明原色中大胆、卡通化的人物著称，将抽象与波普感性融"
"为一体。"

#. module: library
#: model:product.template,description_sale:library.product_template_32
msgid ""
"A retrospective on the husband-and-wife artist duo famous for large-scale "
"fabric-wrapped installations and environmental art."
msgstr "这对艺术家夫妇的回顾集，他们以大型织物包裹装置和大地艺术闻名。"

#. module: library
#: model:product.template,description_sale:library.product_template_37
msgid ""
"A showcase of award-winning package design from 2008–2026, curated by the "
"Pentawards global design competition."
msgstr "2008–2026 年获奖包装设计展示，由全球设计竞赛 Pentawards 策划。"

#. module: library
#: model:product.template,description_sale:library.product_template_30
msgid ""
"A survey of Atkins' pioneering botanical cyanotype prints, considered among "
"the first photographically illustrated books ever made."
msgstr ""
"阿特金斯开创性植物蓝晒印相作品的综述，被视为史上最早的照片插图图书之一。"

#. module: library
#: model:product.template,description_sale:library.product_template_27
msgid ""
"A visual history of Adidas sneakers, showcasing iconic and rare designs from "
"the brand's footwear archive."
msgstr "阿迪达斯运动鞋的视觉史，展示该品牌鞋类档案中的标志性设计与稀有款式。"

#. module: library
#: model:product.template,description_sale:library.product_template_26
#: model_terms:product.template,description:library.product_template_26
