"A visually iconic tribute to the legendary rock band, featuring their famous "
"tongue-and-lips logo on the cover."
msgstr ""
"向这支传奇摇滚乐队致敬的视觉经典之作，封面采用他们著名的舌头与嘴唇标志。"

