#. module: library
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:library.product_template_30
msgid ""
"Anna Atkins was a 19th-century botanist and photographer whose cyanotype "
"prints of algae, ferns, and plants are widely regarded as among the earliest "
"photographically illustrated books in history. This collection presents her "
"striking blue-and-white botanical images, celebrating her role as a pioneer "
"at the intersection of science, art, and early photographic technique."
msgstr ""
"安娜·阿特金斯是 19 世纪的植物学家和摄影师，她拍摄的藻类、蕨类和植物蓝晒印相被"
"普遍视为历史上最早的照片插图图书之一。本合集呈现她引人注目的蓝白植物影像，赞"
"颂她作为科学、艺术与早期摄影技术交汇处先驱的角色。"

