#. module: library
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:library.product_template_39
msgid ""
"Made in cooperation with Kubrick's estate, this extensive volume draws on "
"personal archives, production documents, photographs, and correspondence to "
"offer an unprecedented look into the filmmaker's meticulous creative "
"process. Covering his major works from Dr. Strangelove to Eyes Wide Shut, it "
"provides insight into Kubrick's exacting methods and singular vision as one "
"of cinema's most influential directors."
msgstr ""
"本书与库布里克遗产管理方合作完成，广泛引用个人档案、制作文件、照片和通信，前"
"所未有地呈现这位电影人一丝不苟的创作过程。内容涵盖从《奇爱博士》到《大开眼"
"戒》的主要作品，深入剖析库布里克严苛的工作方法，以及他作为影史最具影响力导演"
"之一的独特视野。"

