msgid ""
"Photographer Frédéric Chaubin spent over a decade traveling through the "
"former Soviet republics documenting extraordinary, often surreal "
"architecture built in the final years of the USSR. The buildings — "
"sanatoriums, research institutes, monuments — showcase a startlingly "
"futuristic and experimental late-Soviet design sensibility rarely associated "
"with Communist-era construction, offering a fascinating counter-narrative to "
"typical Brutalist stereotypes."
msgstr ""
"摄影师 Frédéric Chaubin 花了十多年时间走遍前苏联加盟共和国，记录苏联最后几年"
"建造的非凡、往往超现实的建筑。这些建筑——疗养院、研究所、纪念碑——展现出令人惊"
"异的未来主义与实验性晚期苏联设计感，这与人们对共产主义时代建筑的印象大相径"
"庭，也为典型的粗野主义刻板印象提供了引人入胜的反叙事。"

